On 2026-10-16 Microsoft replaced the release post's 2026-10-15 banner with a link to its dedicated post on Exchange servers that become unstable after the October 2026 Windows Server updates ([Microsoft Exchange Team, 2026-10-13](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/exchange/released-october-2026-exchange-server-security-updates/4563014)); that post carries the affected Windows updates, the symptoms and Microsoft's registry workaround ([Microsoft Exchange Team, 2026-10-17](https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/exchange/exchange-servers-may-become-unstable-after-installation-of-october-2026-windows-/4565382)).
